values
  ('BW-BICA-IS', 'BW', 'default', 'Statement of profit or loss', 'income_statement', 'IFRS-SME', date '2010-01-01', null, 'The Botswana Institute of Chartered Accountants (BICA) is the membership and regulatory body of the accounting profession under the Accountants Act, 2010, as amended in 2020; IFRS Accounting Standards are adopted under the Companies Act and the Accountants Act, and public companies and non-exempt private companies prepare their statements under IFRS. IFRS for SMEs is permitted for smaller entities, not mandatory, and the IFRS Foundation''s profile of the country is internally unclear on its status. Botswana has no statutory format for the statements, so these lines are an original presentation by nature of expense that follows IAS 1 / section 4 of IFRS for SMEs (statement of comprehensive income).', 'ifrs-botswana', null, null, '{}'::jsonb),
